    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp01_00",
      "hash64": "40971F3BE7B5C349",
      "text": "네 쪽에서 먼저 인사하러 오다니\\n제법 센스가 생겼는걸![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "40971E3BE7B5C196",
      "text": "나도 카지랑 같이\\n아카데미에 복귀했으니까.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "40971D3BE7B5BFE3",
      "text": "앞으로도 나를 보면\\n2초 안에 인사하러 와야 해![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "EC5CE56AB223E9B5",
      "text": "알았어!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "EC5CE26AB223E49C",
      "text": "엥...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "40971C3BE7B5BE30",
      "text": "어머, 웬일로 고분고분하네.\\n뭐 잘못 먹기라도 한 거야?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp01_03b",
      "hash64": "76834BCAB9D26556",
      "text": "헤헷!\\n너의 그 당황한 표정은\\r\\n언제 봐도 최고라니까![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "4097233BE7B5CA15",
      "text": "아~ 한동안 북신에 있었더니\\n아카데미가 정신없는 것 같단 말이지.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "4097223BE7B5C862",
      "text": "스이록마을에는\\n아~무것도 없잖아!\\r\\n...그 점이 좋은 거지만.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "6F6D1D53F5073B96",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)], 너 말이야...[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "6F6D1E53F5073D49",
      "text": "내가... 그...\\n수슈수슈 하면서 춤추는 거...\\r\\n동영상으로 찍거나 하진 않았지!?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "FE6373F7F3B19B98",
      "text": "안 찍었어",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "FE6376F7F3B1A0B1",
      "text": "사실은...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "6F6D1B53F5073830",
      "text": "휴~ 다행이다!!\\n조종당한 거라고는 하지만\\r\\n내 인생의 유일한 오점이었어![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp02_02b",
      "hash64": "5D9DC1A95B44B356",
      "text": "뭐어!? 야!!\\n당장 지워!! 알았어!?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "6F6D1C53F50739E3",
      "text": "사진이나 동영상 같은 게 남았다간\\n나중에 유명해졌을 때 곤란해진다구![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "6F6D2153F5074262",
      "text": "근데 결국 그...\\n복숭악동이라는 포켓몬은\\r\\n대체 뭐였던 거지?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "6F6D2253F5074415",
      "text": "생각해 봤는데, 분위기라든지 뭔가\\n세벗들이랑 비슷한 것 같지 않아?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp02_select_03",
      "hash64": "FE6375F7F3B19EFE",
      "text": "그런 것 같아!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp02_select_04",
      "hash64": "FE6378F7F3B1A417",
      "text": "그런가?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp02_06",
      "hash64": "6F6D1F53F5073EFC",
      "text": "그렇다니까!!\\n뭔가 관계가 있는 게 분명해![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp02_07",
      "hash64": "6F6D2053F50740AF",
      "text": "뭐, 그렇다고 포켓몬에게\\n직접 들을 수 있는 건 아니니까...\\r\\n진상은 어둠 속에 있는 거나 마찬가지네![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "6E31F34ECDF9D8E7",
      "text": "네 쪽에서\\n먼저 말을 걸어오다니 기특한걸![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "6E31F24ECDF9D734",
      "text": "그 일 뒤로...\\n카지와는 좀 어때?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "10079538DA4A0A53",
      "text": "친하게 지내고 있어!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "10079638DA4A0C06",
      "text": "그럭저럭?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "6E31F54ECDF9DC4D",
      "text": "흐응~?\\n그렇다면 다행이네.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp03_02b",
      "hash64": "38C003E7FF9123DD",
      "text": "흐응~?\\n나쁘지는 않다니 다행이네.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "6E31F44ECDF9DA9A",
      "text": "그 애, 지금...\\n학교 일이라든지 부활동이라든지\\r\\n여러모로 열심히 하고 있어.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "6E31EF4ECDF9D21B",
      "text": "...버팀목이 되어 달라고까지는 하지 않을게.\\n그저 예전처럼 사이좋게 지내 줘.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp03_select_03",
      "hash64": "10079738DA4A0DB9",
      "text": "당연하지!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp03_select_04",
      "hash64": "10079838DA4A0F6C",
      "text": "시유의 부탁이라면야!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "6E31EE4ECDF9D068",
      "text": "응...\\n이런 말 하지 않아도\\r\\n너희는 이미 친구지.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp03_05b",
      "hash64": "38A7F9E7FF7C80FE",
      "text": "그래! 나를 위해서라도\\n꼭 붙어 지내라구![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
