          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_reward_00",
      "hash64": "49C75872B5E6B284",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)][VAR 0x1900(0001)] 시유로부터\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0008)]코믹 안경(그우린차)[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]을 받았다!",
